(- **Honest Power vs. Thermal Accounting \(`DEG-01`..`05`\)**:) Tj T*
(  - When generator reserve drops from `200 kW` to `100 kW`, `G3 \(1 kW survey\) + G4 \(35 kW\) +) Tj T*
