(deficit**\).) Tj T*
(  - With G3's firm `25 kW` turnaround recharge reservation \(`25 + 35 + 45 = 105 kW > 100 ) Tj T*
(kW`\), the `5 kW` firm deficit triggers **`G5` mode step-down \(`45 kW` $\\rightarrow$ `8 kW` ) Tj T*
(`DEGRADED_70PCT_LOSS`\)**, saving `37 kW` power and reducing committed load to `68 kW` \(`32 ) Tj T*
(kW` free margin\) while retaining `30%` capability.) Tj T*
(  - At $30\\,^\\circ\\text{C}$ seawater with $-40\\%$ cooling loop loss \(`72 kW` thermal ) Tj T*
(capacity vs `100 kW` power\), **chilled-water cooling binds first** \(`79.8 kW > 72 kW`\) and ) Tj T*
(steps down `G5` \(`79.8 kW` $\\rightarrow$ `43.5 kW`\).) Tj T*
